== 5. Knowledge Graph Schema ==

=== 5.1 Graph Structure ===

'''Wolfram Pattern:''' Entity-Property-Value triples with relationships

'''BITwiki Implementation:'''
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ BITWIKI KNOWLEDGE GRAPH SCHEMA │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ │
│ NODES (Entity Types) │
│ ├── Concept (abstract ideas) │
│ ├── Entity (concrete things) │
│ │ ├── Organization │
│ │ ├── Person │
│ │ ├── Product │
│ │ └── Protocol │
│ ├── Event (temporal occurrences) │
│ └── Document (sources) │
│ │
│ EDGES (Relationship Types) │
│ ├── is-a (hierarchical) │
│ ├── part-of (composition) │
│ ├── related-to (association) │
│ ├── implements (technical) │
│ ├── precedes (temporal) │
│ └── cites (provenance) │
│ │
│ PROPERTIES (Attributes) │
│ ├── name (multilingual) │
│ ├── description │
│ ├── creation_date │
│ ├── verification_status │
│ └── confidence_score │
│ │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

=== 5.2 RDF Triples Representation ===

```
Subject → Predicate → Object

Examples:
├── Bitcoin → is-a → Blockchain
├── Bitcoin → created-by → SatoshiNakamoto
├── Bitcoin → uses → ProofOfWork
├── Uniswap → implements → AMM
├── Ethereum → precedes → Ethereum2.0
└── Whitepaper → cites → PriorWork
```

